  "prefLabel": "Plc 1408.02 ATRA Code of Ethics for Recreational Therapists",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1408.02 ATRA Code of Ethics for Recreational Therapists. All recreational therapists shall comply with the Code of Ethics of the American Therapeutic Recreation Association (ATRA) dated July 2009, available as noted in Appendix B.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1400) #13705, eff 8-1-23; ss by #14442, eff 1-26-26, EXPIRES 1-26-36",
